# The help screen: SELECT on a settings section, and what it says.
#
# Down to LoRa - the section phase 1 explains row by row as well as as a whole - then SELECT on
# a row that has its own paragraph, so the screen opens on that paragraph rather than at the
# top. Scrolling up from there reaches the section's own overview, which is the half of the
# design a still picture cannot show.
scene demo
scale 4
delay 180
config

tab settings
hold 500
key down 8
hold 400
key a
hold 700
key down 3
hold 700
key select
hold 1000
key up 2
hold 900
key down 4
hold 900
key b
hold 700
